{"seq":8,"slug":"ci-cd-pipelines","title":"CI/CD 流水线","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-流水线-简介\">CI/CD 流水线 简介</h1><p>持续集成与持续交付（CI/CD）是现代软件工程的基础设施，它将代码从提交到上线的全过程自动化，消除手工操作带来的风险与低效。一条设计良好的流水线不仅能加速交付节奏，更能通过自动化测试、代码质量门禁和渐进式部署来保障软件质量。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于有一定开发经验、希望系统掌握 CI/CD 工程实践的中高级工程师。无论你是负责搭建团队基础设施的平台工程师，还是希望优化自身开发流程的应用开发者，本知识库都能提供实用的技术方案与设计思路。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，从基础概念到高级部署策略逐层展开：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>流水线基础</strong>，建立 CI/CD 的核心概念框架，讲解流水线的设计原则、构建自动化与制品管理，帮助读者理解流水线的整体架构与关键组成。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>GitHub Actions</strong>，以当前最流行的 CI/CD 平台为载体，深入讲解工作流定义、触发机制、自定义 Actions 开发以及性能优化，提供可直接落地的实践方案。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>CI 中的测试</strong>，聚焦测试在流水线中的组织与执行，涵盖测试策略设计、并行测试加速以及不稳定测试的治理方法，确保自动化测试成为质量保障的可靠防线。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>部署策略</strong>，讲解蓝绿部署、金丝雀发布和回滚策略等高级部署模式，帮助读者实现零停机、低风险的持续交付。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先学习第一章建立概念基础，然后通过第二章的 GitHub Actions 实战掌握具体平台的使用，再学习第三章优化测试环节，最后通过第四章的部署策略完成从代码到生产的全链路覆盖。建议边学边在实际项目中搭建流水线，在真实反馈中迭代优化。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline-fundamentals","title":"流水线基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-cd-concepts","title":"CI/CD 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/ci-cd-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-design","title":"流水线设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/pipeline-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"build-automation","title":"构建自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/build-automation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"artifact-management","title":"制品管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-fundamentals/artifact-management"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"github-actions","title":"GitHub Actions","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"actions-fundamentals","title":"GitHub Actions 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions/actions-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"workflow-patterns","title":"工作流模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions/workflow-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"custom-actions","title":"自定义 Action 开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions/custom-actions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"actions-optimization","title":"Actions 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions/actions-optimization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-in-ci","title":"CI 中的测试","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"test-strategies","title":"CI 测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci/test-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"parallel-testing","title":"并行测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci/parallel-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"flaky-tests","title":"Flaky 测试治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci/flaky-tests"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"deployment-strategies","title":"部署策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"blue-green","title":"蓝绿部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies/blue-green"},{"seq":2,"slug":"canary-deployment","title":"金丝雀部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies/canary-deployment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rollback-strategies","title":"回滚策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies/rollback-strategies"}]}]}